    "summary": "Fixed floating gate inputs by routing OR output Y1 from bottom-row Pin 3 (BB_G32) instead of top-row Pin 12, moved Y0 LED wire to full term output 7408 Pin 6 (BB_H25), connected ~D0 to 7408 Pin 1, and grounded the 7408 IC.",
